    <briefdescription>
<para>A class that wraps MachineInstrs and derives from <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a368e3de8ea854f34bc97c21a64d6a164" kindref="member">FoldingSetNode</ref> in order to be uniqued in a CSEMap. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The tradeoff here is extra memory allocations for <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_unique_machine_instr" kindref="compound">UniqueMachineInstr</ref> vs making <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_instr" kindref="compound">MachineInstr</ref> bigger. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
